#: ../../examples/observability.rst:2
msgid "Observe usage and timing"
msgstr "观察用量与耗时"

#: ../../examples/observability.rst:4
msgid "Record token usage, prompt-cache hits, and reasoning/content timing without changing how your application runs an agent. The model's counts are fixtures; the example does not measure provider prices."
msgstr "记录 token 用量、提示词缓存命中和推理/内容的耗时，同时不必改变应用运行智能体的方式。模型给出的计数是固定值；该示例并不度量模型提供商的价格。"

