msgstr "在仓库根目录下执行："

#: ../../examples/observability.rst:17
msgid "The output includes:"
msgstr "输出包含："

#: ../../examples/observability.rst:23
msgid "This program uses deterministic offline models and temporary storage where needed. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序在需要时使用确定性的离线模型和临时存储。它不需要 API 密钥，并由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/observability.rst:27
msgid "Record the completed message"
msgstr "记录完成后的消息"

#: ../../examples/observability.rst:29
msgid "Use an extension when you want the finalized message, usage, and timing together, rather than each display delta:"
msgstr "如果你想同时拿到最终确定的消息、用量和耗时，而不是一个个显示增量，就使用扩展："

#: ../../examples/observability.rst:36
#, python-format
msgid "The example retains records in a list and checks a 60% cache-hit rate. For a long-running service, send records to a bounded queue or telemetry sink instead of keeping an unbounded list in memory. Reported cache usage depends on the provider; missing usage is not a measured zero."
msgstr "该示例把记录保存在列表中，并检查 60% 的缓存命中率。对于长期运行的服务，应把记录发送到有界队列或遥测接收端，而不是在内存中保留一个无界列表。上报的缓存用量取决于模型提供商；缺少用量并不等于实测的零。"

